    {
      "text": "→南無",
      "lang": "zh-Hant-TW",
      "register": "dictionary",
      "source_id": "moe-tw-concised-dictionary-2014-20260626",
      "source_entry_id": "1581",
      "verbatim": true
    },
    {
      "text": "1.南極所在的方向。與「北」相對。[例]坐北朝南、大江南北\r\n2.向南行、向南移動。[例]南行、南下\r\n3.南邊的。[例]南岸、南極\r\n4.姓。",
      "lang": "zh-Hant-TW",
      "register": "dictionary",
